{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/Wishlist_Image.png?t=1747499654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> and his cursed <strong>cheese dip</strong> brings everything it touches\u2014dolls, mannequins, even factory machines\u2014to life in horrifying, twisted forms. Play as high school junior <strong>Gordi</strong> and\u00a0enter the abandoned <strong>Monterey Jack Cheese Factory</strong> in search of your missing friend <strong>Mikey</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WILLY WONKA MEETS HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/Jack_Border.gif?t=1747499654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Drip, drop, the dairy's near\u2014Monterey Jack is what you fear!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> hunts you in real time, stalking the vast Cheese Factory with dynamic AI. Stay alert\u2014watch your noise meter and follow his cheesy footprints, or risk getting caught off guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHO CUT THE CHEESE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/Cut_Cheese.gif?t=1747499654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Jack is not alone. His army of cheese zombies must be chopped into bits!</i> <i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OUTRUN, OUTSMART, AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/Monterey_Jack_Baddies_Small.gif?t=1747499654\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><i>Enemies have detailed hitboxes, requiring players to find weak spots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>makeshift weapons</strong> such as <strong>slingshots, nail guns, and kitchen knives</strong> to fight a large cast of cheese-born baddies. Enemies react based on where they are hit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE MASSIVE CHEESE FACTORY</strong> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/Boat.gif?t=1747499654\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Travel the cheese river to explore the cheese factory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Monterey Jack</strong> offers a solid\u00a0<strong>3 to 4-hour horror experience</strong> packed with <strong>terrifying encounters, intense chases, and heart-stopping jump scares.</strong> With <strong>multiple endings</strong>, <strong>leaderboards</strong>, and even a <strong>Survival Mode</strong>: where\u00a0players have to run from Jack for as long as they can, with their time going up on a Steam <strong>leaderboard</strong>. <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512950?t=1747499654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747499654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/3df1e6cc92a023ca6cda76427db14c54cffa81d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747499654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/3df1e6cc92a023ca6cda76427db14c54cffa81d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747499654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Players will encounter grotesque cheese-themed monsters, including the terrifying Monterey Jack, who relentlessly hunts them. The game features scenes of violence, including melee and ranged combat against nightmarish creatures."},"controller_